    <name>Recovery (54min)</name>
    <description>Warmup: 9min from 50% to 80% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 55% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 95% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 100% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 105% FTP | Steady: 7min @ 55% FTP | Steady: 1min 10s @ 65% FTP | Steady: 3min @ 55% FTP | Steady: 1min 10s @ 65% FTP | Steady: 3min @ 55% FTP | Steady: 1min 10s @ 65% FTP | Steady: 3min @ 55% FTP | Steady: 1min 10s @ 65% FTP | Steady: 5min @ 55% FTP | Steady: 1min 10s @ 65% FTP | Steady: 5min @ 55% FTP | Steady: 1min 20s @ 65% FTP | Cooldown: 7min from 55% to 35% FTP</description>
